    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The body naturally experiences stress as a result of the demands made on it. In tiny doses, it can be helpful since it can keep us motivated and focused. Nevertheless, our mental and physical health may be negatively impacted by prolonged or overwhelming amounts of stress. As a result, it's critical to understand stress and how to properly handle it in our daily lives.",
